---
---
<div class="comments-section">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 760px; padding: 3rem 1.5rem 4rem;">
    <div class="comments-header">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-white); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Commentaires</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.92rem;">Une question, un retour d'expérience ? Laisse un commentaire !</p>
      <div class="divider" style="margin: 0.75rem 0 0;"></div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 2rem;">
      <script
        src="https://utteranc.es/client.js"
        repo="Laauuriita/mon-site-seo"
        issue-term="pathname"
        label="💬 commentaire"
        theme="github-dark"
        crossorigin="anonymous"
        async
      ></script>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top: 1.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); text-align: center; padding: 0.75rem; background: var(--color-surface-2); border-radius: var(--radius); border: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
      💡 Connexion GitHub requise pour commenter — gratuit et sans pub.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
<style>
.comments-section { background: var(--color-surface); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
</style>
